    "causal_summary": "Carry the opaque session id raw into the router, encode it once at the router boundary, then re-validate id + epoch at the chat page before loading the transcript or issuing any command. Model selection precedence (selected / host-active / navigation-requested) as separate presentation states; keep the list jump-to-latest FAB distinct from the per-turn scroll arrow; record load-earlier as not-portable-now; and add a per-session device-local view-mode preference that fails closed when its store is unreadable. Plan only \u2014 nothing implements until the operator says go.",
